enerate. Select the model and settings, review the displayed amount, and confirm. Prices are in AED, inclusive of VAT.\"}]]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"details\",\"How do I choose between AI video models?\",{\"className\":\"group py-5\",\"open\":false,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":[\"How do I choose between AI video models?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\",\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Use the same short prompt, aspect ratio, and source image in two models. Compare motion quality, subject consistency, audio support, duration, resolution, and cost. Choose the output that fits the final channel.\"}]]}]\n38:null\n1a:0\nc:\"$undefined\"\n5:\"$undefined\"\n19:\"$undefined\"\nf:\"$undefined\"\n12:\"$undefined\"\n"}}